Z||000000||86SE||07-17-2000||11:55 PM||||I went to both U-pul-it yards here in Omaha the other day in search of some small Fiero parts.  2 weeks ago there were a total of 4 Fieros at the yards, 2 still pretty much complete.  Got there and neither one of them had any Fieros!!  Somebody must have bought all the Fieros they could find......  There are 3 Fieros in the area of the shop im at.....<P>But I did find a rolled Porsche 944 (early 80's) and a old Alfa-Romero at the parts yards.<P>And I pulled of a turbo emblem off of a Pontiac Turbo GT car, the turbo was still on the motor and everything, and the motor looked in excellent shape!  Looked like a 2.8, I should have taken the turbo!!<P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Fiero||||reg||13
