Z||000003||Formula||07-19-2000||08:27 AM||||I know of 3 fieros that disappeared from my local salvage yards in a days time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  I still have 2 84s for body panels (in the yards) and 1 88 coupe for panels, no more V6s here for me.... there is 1 fastback but somone cut the rear clip in half, and took the fascia, seats, dash, ground efects, wheels, wing, hood, the only good fender, steering wheel, EVERYTHING that could be used, I think there is a fiero collector around here that Im not aware of. ||||reg||1
